t you know that i'm exploring  two languages i'm going to keep them  apart  the arabic helps my  persian or farsi because there are some  identifiable arabic words in pharisee  plus the writing system is is very very  close  and but if i were going for an exam if i  had needed the language for my work i  would simply focus on one language but  i'm in a position where i can afford to  be a dilettante so there you have it on  learning two languages at the same time  in this case arabic and now farsi we'll  see how far i get  thank you for listening bye for now  [Music]  you
 

